<title>USA: Clarke Cty, Ga., deal repriced, 2027 yield raised.</title>
<headline>Clarke Cty, Ga., deal repriced, 2027 yield raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robinson-Humphrey Co said Monday it repriced $60.9 million Hospital Authority of Clarke County, Ga., hospital revenue certificates raising yields in several maturities and lifting the top yield in 2027 to approximately 5.661 percent from 5.65 percent.</p>
